<title>TURKEY: Marc Rich wins 35,000 tonne Turkish naphtha tender.</title>
<headline>Marc Rich wins 35,000 tonne Turkish naphtha tender.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state oil refining company Tupras said on Wednesday it sold up to 35,000 tonnes of naphtha to the Swiss trading company Marc Rich Investment AG through a tender.</p>
<p>It said the award was made at a premium of $6.2 per tonne over benchmark quotes.</p>
<p>A maximum of 15,000 tonnes of naphtha would be loaded from Aliaga port between March 10-12 and 18,000-20,000 tonnes from Tutunciftlik between March 13-15, it said.</p>
<p>The tender was held on February 25.</p>
<p>--Ankara Newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
